+# AutoVideoAI v7.0.70 — ChatGPT Web and Indus AI drafting
+
+## What changed
+
+- **ChatGPT Web drafting (new).** Create → Drafting model → "ChatGPT Web (signed-in browser session)".
+  It works like Gemini Web: a visible browser window with a saved profile. Sign in to ChatGPT once in that
+  window; later drafts reuse the session. Each draft opens a fresh chat and returns when the reply stops changing.
+  - Default cleanup, `delete-after-read`, uses a ChatGPT **temporary chat**, so the draft is not kept in your history.
+  - Set "Draft chat cleanup" to `keep` to save the draft to your ChatGPT history.
+  - Optional environment variables: `CHATGPT_WEB_LOGIN_WAIT` (seconds to wait for sign-in, default 300),
+    `CHATGPT_WEB_RESPONSE_TIMEOUT` (default 300), `CHATGPT_WEB_BROWSER_MODE`, `CHATGPT_WEB_BROWSER_CHANNEL`,
+    `CHATGPT_WEB_BROWSER_EXE`, `CHATGPT_WEB_CDP_URL`.
+- **Indus AI drafting (new, optional).** Sarvam's Indus model through the Sarvam API. Create → Drafting model →
+  "Indus AI · Sarvam". Set `SARVAM_API_KEY`. Model defaults to `sarvam-105b`; override with `SARVAM_SCRIPT_MODEL`.
+  Reasoning is off so the output budget goes to the script; `SARVAM_MAX_TOKENS` (default 4096) caps the reply.
+  Indus is also available as a job-level script provider.
+- Cleanup control label is now "Draft chat cleanup" and applies to both Gemini Web and ChatGPT Web.
+
+## Not yet verified
+
+- The ChatGPT Web selectors were written for the current ChatGPT web app but have not been tested against a live
+  session. If ChatGPT changes its page, the selectors in `engine/providers/chatgpt_web.py` (`SELECTORS`) need adjusting.
+- Indus AI's Odia coverage is not confirmed by Sarvam's documentation. Check an Odia script draft before relying on it.
+  Gemini Web or ChatGPT Web remain the defaults for Odia.
+
+## Updating
+
+- From 7.0.69: run `python3 ../AutoVideoAI-v7.0.70/tools/update_v769_to_v770.py .` (dry run), then add `--apply`.
+- From 7.0.68: first run the 7.0.69 updater, then the 7.0.70 updater.
+- Only code and documentation are replaced. Outputs, jobs, browser profiles, music, characters and channel profiles are untouched.
